  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure this stunning architectural coastal home, with construction well underway and completion before Christmas.\r\n\r\nSet in an elevated position with sweeping sea views, this beautifully designed two-storey residence by award-winning Madison Park Homes delivers contemporary coastal living with a refined combination of Abodo timber, Sto plaster exterior finishes, louvre feature detailing and considered architectural design throughout.\r\n\r\nConstruction is progressing , with internal fit-out just about to commence. This is an exciting opportunity to secure a brand-new architectural home without the time and uncertainty of starting a build from scratch.\r\n\r\nAsking Price: **By Negotiation\r\n\r\nKey Features – Premium Specification\r\n•\tArchitecturally designed two-storey residence with sea views\r\n•\t10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n•\tStunning custom-designed kitchen and separate scullery\r\n•\tCustom wine cellar\r\n•\tLuxurious master ensuite / wet room\r\n•\tGenerous master walk-in wardrobe and dressing area\r\n•\tSeparate media room\r\n•\tTwo separate powder rooms\r\n•\tTwo bathrooms, including ensuite\r\n•\tDucted heating throughout\r\n•\tFeature fireplace\r\n•\tTimber herringbone flooring\r\n•\tPremium materials and carefully considered architectural detailing\r\n•\tStriking Abodo timber and Sto plaster exterior\r\n\r\nSecure this stunning Coastal Home Before Christmas!!!!!\r\n\r\nWith construction already underway and the internal fit-out about to commence, this is an opportunity to purchase a brand-new architectural home with anticipated completion before Christmas.\r\n\r\nThe design and specification have been carefully considered to create a beautiful, functional home embracing its coastal setting and elevated sea views.\r\nImages are 3D renders illustrating the higher-specification design intent and proposed finishes. \r\n\r\nEnquire Today\r\nContact Madison Park Homes to arrange a discussion and find out more about securing this exceptional coastal property.\r\n\r\nWhy wait to build when you could be settling into your brand-new coastal home before Christmas?",
